This repository is a device-specific port of the GhostLock exploit for
CVE-2026-43499. The original exploit was published by NebuSec in the
CyberMeowfia / IonStack project.

KernelSnitch is based on research and code from the Institute of Applied
Information Processing and Communications (IAIK), Graz University of
Technology.

Port authorship and AI disclosure are documented in README.md. Third-party
projects retain their own copyrights and licenses.
